              连续翻页可无重无漏到达第一条可见消息。
              </?01M1JZQEA819EKJ416CBYHH4XG>
              <Criterion #P2-T2-AC2 { checked = true } ?01M1JZQEA819EKJ416CBYHH4XH>
              rewind/compaction/fork 后旧 cursor typed stale，隐藏分支尾部不泄漏。
              </?01M1JZQEA819EKJ416CBYHH4XH>
            ]>
          )>
        ]>
      )>
      <TaskGroup #P3 { name = "TUI 分页窗口与增量滚动" status = "DONE" priority = "P0" order = 2 } (
        <Description ?01M1JZQEA819EKJ416CBYHH4XJ>
        贯通 TerminalRuntime、TuiRuntimeClient 和主视图，只读尾页首屏并以 window/spacer 挂载卡片。
        </?01M1JZQEA819EKJ416CBYHH4XJ>
        <SubNodes [
          <Task #P3-T1 { name = "贯通 runtime session history page API" status = "DONE" priority = "P0" order = 0 } (
            <Description ?01M1JZQEA819EKJ416CBYHH4XK>
            bridge 与 session.messages 支持 page 请求/metadata，主恢复改用尾页且兼容旧调用。
            </?01M1JZQEA819EKJ416CBYHH4XK>
            <Acceptance [
              <Criterion #P3-T1-AC1 { checked = true } ?01M1JZQEA819EKJ416CBYHH4XM>
