              </?01M1JZQEA819EKJ416CBYHH4XM>
              <Criterion #P3-T1-AC2 { checked = true } ?01M1JZQEA819EKJ416CBYHH4XN>
              现有无 cursor 调用及命令面板行为保持兼容。
              </?01M1JZQEA819EKJ416CBYHH4XN>
            ]>
          )>
          <Task #P3-T2 { name = "实现 viewport window、spacer 与测量" status = "DONE" priority = "P0" order = 1 } (
            <Description ?01M1JZQEA819EKJ416CBYHH4XP>
            按 viewport/overscan 选择消息卡片，缓存高度并用上下 spacer 保持连续滚动几何。
            </?01M1JZQEA819EKJ416CBYHH4XP>
            <Acceptance [
              <Criterion #P3-T2-AC1 { checked = true } ?01M1JZQEA819EKJ416CBYHH4XQ>
